This folder carries rules from GitHub Linguist (https://github.com/github-linguist/linguist),
version v9.7.0, commit e0c78d62c42abae6122235d8e68a7aa43eef89da, used under the MIT licence.

Files copied from Linguist unchanged:
- vendor.yml, from lib/linguist/vendor.yml
- generated.rb, from lib/linguist/generated.rb

Files that port Linguist's rules from those two files to TypeScript:
- vendor-patterns.ts (the patterns of vendor.yml)
- generated-rules.ts (the rules of Generated#generated? in generated.rb)
- ruby.ts (the Ruby behaviour those rules rely on)
- index.ts (the mark that applies them)

The files are read as data and are never run as Ruby.

